### Manage access

Access is authorized by **AWS IAM identity**. The `auth-sidecar` validates a short-lived STS
`GetCallerIdentity` token minted by `jd proxy connect-info` and checks the caller's ARN against the
`auth_arn_allowlist` (defaults to the deployer's ARN). To grant additional identities, add their ARNs to
the `auth_arn_allowlist` entry in the `overrides:` block of `./variables.yaml`, then re-apply with
`jd config` followed by `jd up`.

